<mujoco model="shadow_hand_repose">
  <!--
    Shadow Hand cube reorientation (Isaac Lab repose-cube, ported to MuJoCo by the SSR bundle
    `shadow_hand_mujoco_gui_bundle_20260826`), derived for this runtime by plan H task H1
    (docs/packets/M16/plan-h.md). PROVENANCE.json lists the source, its sha256 and every edit.
    The physics is the source's: the edits drop what SceneDesc does not represent (MuJoCo's own
    rendering, user data, memory sizing, the touch sensors), spell the servos as the
    <position> they are, write four orientations as the unit vectors SceneDesc stores (two of
    them move MuJoCo's compiled model by one bit), move the floating goal cube beside the hand,
    and add what the path-traced cameras need (three cameras, an emitter, alpha 0 on what
    should not be drawn).
    Appearance (packet H1b): the cube and the goal wear the bundle's `block.png` cube texture
    and the hand the bundle's MatViz / MatColl materials, as the source declares them, less
    `reflectance` (not rendered here). The goal's 0.5 alpha draws opaque (transparency is not
    rendered either). Nothing here reaches the dynamics.
    One dynamics edit (packet H2b): the hand joints' class armature is 0.001, gymnasium-robotics'
    own value (the bundle's Isaac-parity 0 made MuJoCo's qacc blow up and auto-reset the data
    under policy-like servo targets); the wrists keep their explicit 0.005.
  -->
  <compiler angle="radian" meshdir="meshes/" texturedir="textures/"/>

  <option timestep="0.008333333333333333" integrator="implicitfast" iterations="20"/>

  <default>
    <default class="robot0:asset_class">
      <joint limited="true" armature="0.001" stiffness="0" damping="0" frictionloss="0"/>
      <geom friction="1 0 0" margin="0"/>
      <position ctrllimited="true" forcelimited="true"/>
    </default>
    <default class="robot0:DC_Hand">
      <!-- MatColl as the source names it; alpha 0 on the geom overrides the material's 1
           (MuJoCo's setMaterial), so the collision geoms draw nothing. -->
      <geom conaffinity="0" material="robot0:MatColl" rgba="0.4 0.5 0.6 0"/>
    </default>
    <default class="robot0:D_Vizual">
      <geom type="mesh" contype="0" conaffinity="0" material="robot0:MatViz"/>
    </default>
    <default class="robot0:free">
      <joint type="free"/>
    </default>
  </default>

